text_output=And so those are some of the areas that we're talking for robotics. And then on edge, some people were saying like, gosh, edge, we've been in that old business. We're trying to grow that business, but it is a different strategy. I think that's one that Alex has been very helpful in bringing a different perspective on that approach.
